{%- comment -%}
  The site's font: Jost, for headings and text alike, the owner's choice on
  2026-09-14 (option E, after seeing it on hestiahome.bg). Headings are bold,
  as on the board the owner chose.

  Loaded from the theme's own files, not Shopify's font library. Every font file
  Shopify hosts is Latin-only -- Shopify's Jost included -- so with a library
  font each Bulgarian word falls back to the visitor's system font. These files
  are the originals from Google Fonts, SIL Open Font License, split by alphabet.
  unicode-range lets the browser download only the parts a page uses, usually
  the upright Cyrillic and Latin files, under 40 KB together.

  The family name ends in "Theme" so it can never be matched to a Shopify
  library copy of Jost, which has no Cyrillic.

  Rendered in the head of layout/theme.liquid, layout/password.liquid and
  templates/gift_card.liquid, after Dawn's :root block, whose font variables
  it overrides. The Typography font pickers in the theme editor no longer
  change the font; the size sliders still work.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%}theme-check-disable AssetPreload{%- endcomment -%}
<link rel="preload" as="font" href="{{ 'font-jost-normal-cyrillic.woff2' | asset_url }}" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="preload" as="font" href="{{ 'font-jost-normal-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
{%- comment -%}theme-check-enable AssetPreload{%- endcomment -%}

<style>
  /* Jost, normal, cyrillic */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-normal-cyrillic.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0301, U+0400-045F, U+0490-0491, U+04B0-04B1, U+2116;
  }

  /* Jost, normal, latin */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-normal-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }

  /* Jost, normal, latin-ext */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-normal-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
  }

  /* Jost, italic, cyrillic */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-italic-cyrillic.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0301, U+0400-045F, U+0490-0491, U+04B0-04B1, U+2116;
  }

  /* Jost, italic, latin */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-italic-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }

  /* Jost, italic, latin-ext */
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Jost Theme";
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300 700;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'font-jost-italic-latin-ext.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0100-02BA, U+02BD-02C5, U+02C7-02CC, U+02CE-02D7, U+02DD-02FF, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+1D00-1DBF, U+1E00-1E9F, U+1EF2-1EFF, U+2020, U+20A0-20AB, U+20AD-20C0, U+2113, U+2C60-2C7F, U+A720-A7FF;
  }

  :root {
    --font-body-family: "Jost Theme", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-body-style: normal;
    --font-body-weight: 400;
    --font-body-weight-bold: 700;

    /* Bold, as on the board the owner chose. */
    --font-heading-family: "Jost Theme", "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
    --font-heading-style: normal;
    --font-heading-weight: 700;
  }
</style>
